citation: |
  Aperio ImageScope region-crop export of a 590 tissue-microarray slide, fully
  owned by Toby C. Cornish / WSILabs and contributed expressly for the
  wsi-fixtures corpus under CC BY 4.0 (attribution required). JPEG 2000 tiled
  encoding (an Aperio-legitimate SVS codec). One of four ImageScope-export
  codec variants (jp2k/jpeg70 as .svs; lzw/none as .tif) exercising the full
  associated-image + tile-codec decode matrix.
